### Bengkel Gemilang Sakti - API Quick Test
### Gunakan dengan REST Client extension di VS Code

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Get All Spareparts
GET {{baseUrl}}/spareparts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get Sparepart by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/spareparts/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Create Sparepart
POST {{baseUrl}}/spareparts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SP-TEST-001",
  "name": "Test Sparepart",
  "supplier_id": 1,
  "buy_price": 50000,
  "sell_price": 75000,
  "stock": 10
}

### 5. Update Sparepart
PUT {{baseUrl}}/spareparts/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Sparepart Name",
  "stock": 20
}

### 6. Delete Sparepart
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/spareparts/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ========================================
### SUPPLIERS
### ========================================

### Get All Suppliers
GET {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Supplier
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SUP-TEST-01",
  "name": "Test Supplier",
  "address": "Jl. Test No. 123",
  "phone": "021-1234567"
}

### Update Supplier
PUT {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Supplier Name",
  "phone": "021-9999999"
}

### Delete Supplier
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/suppliers/5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

