### ========================================
### EMPLOYEES
### ========================================

### Get All Employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create Employee
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "KRY-TEST-01",
  "name": "Test Employee",
  "position": "Mekanik",
  "base_salary": 3000000
}

### Update Employee
PUT {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Employee Name",
  "base_salary": 3500000
}

### Delete Employee
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

